# Aura Stream - Supabase Configuration
# Optional: If not provided, Aura Stream runs seamlessly in High-Fidelity Demo & Local Persistence Mode!
# When you have your Supabase project ready:
# 1. Run the SQL schema in supabase/schema.sql in your Supabase SQL Editor
# 2. Paste your project URL and anon public key below:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
